# ParcelPilot (core)

Python FastAPI + LangGraph. Query in → orchestrator sees registered tools → model picks tool calls → ToolNode runs them → loop until a final answer. Response includes a **tool_trace**.

**Call chain:** `api → service → compiled graph → TOOL_REGISTRY handler`

| Layer | Must | Must not |
|-------|------|----------|
| `app/api/` | validate, one service call | graph compile, SQL, business rules |
| `app/services/` | orchestrate graph invoke + tool_trace | raw SQL |
| `app/tools/` | `@tool` definition + register once | HTTP routes |
| `app/workflows/` | StateGraph, ToolNode, pure routers | import api/tasks |
| `app/domain/` | state types | import api/tasks |

Add a tool: `app/tools/definitions/<name>.py` (`@tool` + docstring + type hints) then `register()` in `app/tools/registry.py`. No new graph nodes or routes.

Routers are pure `state → str`. Nodes are thin. Search existing tools before adding.

Tests live under `tests/unit/`, `tests/integrations/`, `tests/e2e/`.
